---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<PageLayout title="Terms of Use and Disclaimer" description={`Terms of use and disclaimer for ${SITE.name}: the tools are provided as they are, and users must check official notifications for exam rules.`} h1="Terms of use and disclaimer" crumb="Terms and disclaimer" updated="2026-10-04">
  {/* AUTHOR REVIEW: read these terms and adjust anything that does not match how you want to run the site. This is general information, not legal advice. */}
  <h2>Use of the site</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} offers free tools and guides for general information and convenience. You may use them for personal,
    educational and professional purposes. Please do not misuse the site or try to disrupt it.
  </p>
  <h2>No official or legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    We are not connected with any examination body, university, board or government department. The tools and guides do
    not state the official photo, signature or document requirements of any exam. Always read the official notification
    for your exam and follow it. Presets in the tools are generic examples only.
  </p>
  <h2>Accuracy of results</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to make the calculators and converters correct, but we cannot guarantee that every result is free from
    error or suits your purpose. Grade scales, CGPA conversion rules and age limits vary between institutions. Check
    important results against the rules of the organisation that will use them. You are responsible for checking a file
    before you submit it.
  </p>
  <h2>No warranty and limit of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The site and its tools are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent permitted by law,
    we are not liable for any loss, including a rejected application, arising from the use of the site.
  </p>
  <h2>Your content</h2>
  <p>
    You keep all rights to the files you process. They are handled only in your browser and are not sent to us. See the
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Advertising and external links</h2>
  <p>The site may display third-party advertising and link to other sites. We do not control or endorse them.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may change these terms. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the new terms.</p>
</PageLayout>
